HEAD TO HEAD -- rank rho by k
================================================================================================
       k     saddle (quadratic)    bumps (not quadratic)
      30              -0.028123                +0.593417
     231              +0.083639                +0.423580
     500              +0.392984                +0.644656

  rank gain from k=30 to k=500:  saddle +0.421107   bumps +0.051239

  CONFOUNDED. The rank gain is largely specific to the globally-quadratic saddle.
  A local-quadric estimator whose ball covers the manifold recovers that fixture's
  exact global model. It transfers to nothing that is not itself a quadric.
